{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/27bc387dac32e6b8346e6a0228cb4bf0.avif?t=1765722528\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras_big/27bc387dac32e6b8346e6a0228cb4bf0.avif?t=1765722528 width=800 height=386 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead Station Files</strong> is a turn\u2011based roguelike about surviving on a doomed space station, experienced entirely through the  <strong>Evacom\u2122</strong> <strong>\u2014 </strong>portable emergency<strong>\u00a0</strong>\u200bterminal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Events and crew narratives are captured as Evacom\u2122 data files, recorded by each character from their perspective. Load any file to live through that crew member\u2019s final run and stitch together the full picture of the catastrophe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catastrophe via Evacom\u2122</strong>\u00a0<strong>:\u00a0</strong>The entire experience plays out within the Evacom\u2122 terminal, letting you relive the space station\u2019s collapse from the perspective of its crew.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/633e7d9e17725ba050ddb8749fb6f497.poster.avif?t=1765722528\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/633e7d9e17725ba050ddb8749fb6f497.webm?t=1765722528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/633e7d9e17725ba050ddb8749fb6f497.mp4?t=1765722528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every level is generated 100% solvable puzzle:</strong> Advance level by level, compartment by compartment \u2014 until you reach the exit\u2026 or run out of time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/651343a87e2db61bbac7d51456d0dea8.poster.avif?t=1765722528\" width=800 height=514 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/651343a87e2db61bbac7d51456d0dea8.webm?t=1765722528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/651343a87e2db61bbac7d51456d0dea8.mp4?t=1765722528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based tactics:</strong> Plan your moves, avoid deadly threats, and manage limited resources under pressure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/9af0b7f5373c2b6e1cecfcb0ef2b9dd9.poster.avif?t=1765722528\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/9af0b7f5373c2b6e1cecfcb0ef2b9dd9.webm?t=1765722528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/9af0b7f5373c2b6e1cecfcb0ef2b9dd9.mp4?t=1765722528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death at every turn:</strong> You will die. A lot. A space catastrophe is no place for fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/abacc6d737c87853e305ff4179adae10.poster.avif?t=1765722528\" width=800 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/abacc6d737c87853e305ff4179adae10.webm?t=1765722528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/abacc6d737c87853e305ff4179adae10.mp4?t=1765722528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conduct your own investigation:</strong> Organize recovered data and reconstruct the true timeline of the disaster, unlocking new characters and gameplay modes as you piece together the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/323ab3ed1c8759b4eca3bb7303d20409.poster.avif?t=1765722528\" width=1120 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/323ab3ed1c8759b4eca3bb7303d20409.webm?t=1765722528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/323ab3ed1c8759b4eca3bb7303d20409.mp4?t=1765722528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time is your greatest enemy:</strong>\u00a0You can influence the flow of events, but you can\u2019t stop the catastrophe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/7dd23dcc40edde5509576eb4ed7520d9.poster.avif?t=1765722528\" width=432 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/7dd23dcc40edde5509576eb4ed7520d9.webm?t=1765722528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/7dd23dcc40edde5509576eb4ed7520d9.mp4?t=1765722528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3687410?t=1765722528","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/1adc6c58b6ae584df87683f4c23930e140747ae8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765722528","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/6a513616c99146056b16234d8f33837843972e2f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765722528","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/6a513616c99146056b16234d8f33837843972e2f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765722528","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains realistic depictions of blood, though they are infrequent and not the primary focus.\r\nPlayers may encounter scenes involving the implied death of characters, often represented through schematic visuals and atmospheric audio.\r\nThe narrative explores themes of isolation, survival, and catastrophic failure in a sci-fi horror setting.\r\nWhile there is no graphic violence or gore, the tone is tense and may not be appropriate for all players."},"demos":[{"appid":3691870,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/27bc387dac32e6b8346e6a0228cb4bf0.avif?t=1765722528\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras_bi